Patch 0006 (deterministic-ldl) of fid-clarabel, spec node KRN.SOLV.CONIC.PATCH.

Deterministic LDL path: replace AMD (amd crate) with an exact minimum-degree ordering computed from the sparsity pattern only with lowest-index tie-breaks; bounds-checked factorisation and triangular solves instead of the unsafe copies; a size budget (MAX_ORDERING_DIM, MAX_ORDERING_NNZ, MAX_ORDERING_FILL) with the typed error QDLDLError::OrderingTooLarge (QDLDLError::InvalidPattern for a malformed pattern), and the solver refuses a problem over the budget as bad input.

Rule IDs and rationale: vendor/fid-clarabel/AUDIT.toml.

